      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rehoboth%2C_Massachusetts",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Rehoboth’s only streetcar line, the Providence and Taunton Street Railway, ran in 1891 along what is now U.S. Route 6.",
